sequenceDiagram
%% v2 Unified People Labeling Flow
%% Aligns with CONSOLIDATED_FACE_DETECTION_PLAN.md Section 6

autonumber
participant User as User (Editor)
participant SPA as WP Admin SPA
participant Overlay as PeopleOverlay
participant Drawer as PeopleDrawer
participant Picker as PeoplePicker
participant Det as DetectionProvider (MediaPipe)
participant Hook as usePeopleSuggestions
participant WP as WP REST (/recognition/identify)
participant Rec as Recognition Service
participant DB as WP DB

%% Phase 1: Image Load + Detection
User->>SPA: Open Workbench, select images
SPA->>Det: Lazy-load MediaPipe model
Det-->>SPA: Model ready (cached after first load)
SPA->>Det: detect(imageElement)
Det-->>SPA: DetectedFace[] {bbox, confidence}

SPA->>Overlay: Render face bounding boxes + "Who is this?" chips
Overlay-->>User: Show face overlays on image

%% Phase 2: Backend Suggestions (Cold Start)
SPA->>Hook: identifyFaces(attachmentId, faces[bbox])
Hook->>WP: POST /recognition/identify {attachmentId, faces[{bbox}]}

WP->>WP: Crop faces server-side (GD/Imagick)
WP->>Rec: POST /embeddings/batch {crops[]}
Rec-->>WP: embeddings[]

WP->>Rec: POST /suggest {embeddings[], topK: 5, threshold: 0.92}
Rec->>Rec: FAISS search roster vectors
Rec-->>WP: suggestions[][] (empty if no roster yet)

WP->>Rec: POST /cluster-unknowns {embeddings[]}
Rec->>Rec: DBSCAN/Agglomerative clustering
Rec-->>WP: clusterIds[]

WP-->>Hook: faces[{faceId, clusterId, suggestions[]}]
Hook-->>Drawer: Update cluster stacks
Drawer-->>User: Show "Likely same person (x12)" groups

%% Phase 3: User Labels First Face
User->>Overlay: Click chip on face #1
Overlay->>Picker: Open PeoplePicker
Picker-->>User: Show typeahead (empty roster) + "Create new" option

User->>Picker: Type "Ana Rodriguez" + click "Create new"
Note over User,Picker: USER CONFIRMATION REQUIRED<br/>No remote sync without explicit action
Picker->>Hook: submitLabel(faceId, {newName: "Ana Rodriguez"})
Hook->>WP: POST /recognition/identify {faces[{bbox, label: {newName}}]}

WP->>DB: INSERT cat_observation (bbox, label_status: 'confirmed')
WP->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE cat_roster_entity (display_name: "Ana Rodriguez")

Note over WP,Rec: Sync to FAISS only after user confirms
WP->>Rec: POST /roster/add-embedding {rosterId, observationId, embedding}
Rec->>Rec: Check observationId not duplicate
Rec->>Rec: Append to FAISS index
Rec->>Rec: Persist index atomically (temp + rename)
Rec-->>WP: {success: true, message: "Embedding added"}

WP->>DB: UPDATE post_meta (synced_to_faiss: true)
WP-->>Hook: {observationId: 123, rosterId: "person-ana-001", syncStatus: "success"}

Note over Hook,User: IMMEDIATE FEEDBACK TO USER
Hook-->>Overlay: Update face chip (show "Ana Rodriguez")
Hook-->>Drawer: Remove from unknown cluster
Hook-->>User: Toast: "✓ Face added to Ana Rodriguez's profile"

%% Phase 4: Warm Start - Suggestions Appear
User->>SPA: Select next batch of images (20 more)
SPA->>Det: detect(images)
Det-->>SPA: DetectedFace[] (40 faces across 20 images)

SPA->>Hook: identifyFaces(attachmentIds[], allFaces[])
Hook->>WP: POST /recognition/identify (bulk request)
WP->>Rec: /embeddings/batch + /suggest

Rec->>Rec: FAISS search (1 person in roster now)
Rec-->>WP: suggestions[] {rosterId: "person-ana-001", score: 0.94}

WP-->>Hook: faces[] with 12 high-confidence "Ana?" suggestions
Hook-->>Drawer: Create suggestion stack "Ana Rodriguez? (12)"
Drawer-->>User: Show suggestion stack with "Confirm All" button

%% Phase 5: Bulk Confirm
User->>Drawer: Click "Confirm All" on "Ana Rodriguez? (12)" stack
Note over User,Drawer: USER CONFIRMATION for bulk action
Drawer->>Hook: bulkConfirm(rosterId, faceIds[])
Hook->>WP: POST /recognition/identify {faces[{bbox, label: {rosterId}}] x12}

WP->>DB: UPDATE cat_observation (label_status: 'confirmed') x12

Note over WP,Rec: Sync each confirmed face to FAISS
loop For each confirmed observation
    WP->>Rec: POST /roster/add-embedding {rosterId, observationId, embedding}
    Rec->>Rec: Check no duplicate observationId
    Rec->>Rec: Append to FAISS index
    Rec-->>WP: {success: true}
    WP->>DB: UPDATE post_meta (synced_to_faiss: true)
end

WP-->>Hook: {observationIds: [124-135], syncStatus: "success"}

Hook-->>Drawer: Remove stack (all confirmed)
Hook-->>Overlay: Update 12 chips to show "Ana Rodriguez"
Hook-->>User: Toast: "✓ 12 faces confirmed as Ana Rodriguez"

%% Phase 6: Misfit Correction
User->>Overlay: Click chip on misidentified face
Overlay->>Picker: Open with current "Ana Rodriguez" shown
Picker-->>User: Typeahead shows "Ana Rodriguez" in roster (prevent duplicates)

User->>Picker: Search "Marta", select "Marta Silva" from dropdown (or create new)
Note over User,Picker: USER CONFIRMATION REQUIRED<br/>No sync without explicit selection
Picker->>Hook: submitLabel(faceId, {rosterId: "person-marta-002"})
Hook->>WP: POST /recognition/identify {faces[{bbox, label: {rosterId}}]}

WP->>DB: UPDATE cat_observation (label_status: 'corrected')

Note over WP,Rec: Sync corrected identity to FAISS
WP->>Rec: POST /roster/add-embedding {rosterId: "person-marta-002", observationId, embedding}
Rec->>Rec: Check no duplicate observationId
Rec->>Rec: Append to FAISS index
Rec-->>WP: {success: true}

WP->>DB: UPDATE post_meta (synced_to_faiss: true)
WP-->>Hook: {observationId: 136, syncStatus: "success"}

Hook-->>Overlay: Update chip to "Marta Silva"
Hook-->>User: Toast: "✓ Face corrected to Marta Silva"
